ht;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;419&lt;/p&gt;
